t we done with this damn tool from a kernel perspective?? Thought,the link"},{"depth":2,"text":"could be removed."},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"This would finalize (fix?) this commit 8e9fa2f21151 (oprofiled version"},{"depth":1,"text":"output line removed from the list)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"Maybe add some reasoning (To reduce it's OS jitter or because it's a leftover link)"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"And if it's the way to handle translations remove:"},{"depth":1,"text":"Documentation/translations/it_IT/process/changes.rst:- <https://oprofile.sf.net/download/>"},{"depth":1,"text":"Documentation/translations/pt_BR/process/changes.rst:- <https://oprofile.sf.net/download/>"},{"depth":1,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":"I have no clue about the technical side, that's why I'm asking:"},{"depth":1,"text":"Can this be removed aswell?"},{"depth":1,"text":"arch/sparc/kernel/nmi.c:atomic_t nmi_active = ATOMIC_INIT(0);           /* oprofile uses this */"}],"lineCount":16,"maximumDepth":2},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"It looks like nmi_active is used in that source file regardless of\noprofile. I'd say No.\nOther than the comment itself, which can be deleted if oprofile support\nis going (gone) away."},{"kind":"quote","lines":[{"depth":2,"text":"Signed-off-by: Bhaskar Chowdhury <unixbhaskar@gmail.com>"},{"depth":2,"text":"---"},{"depth":2,"text":" Documentation/process/changes.rst | 4 ----"},{"depth":2,"text":" 1 file changed, 4 deletions(-)"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"diff --git a/Documentation/process/changes.rst b/Documentation/process/changes.rst"},{"depth":2,"text":"index 0aa232b117b5..336c07190c9b 100644"},{"depth":2,"text":"--- a/Documentation/process/changes.rst"},{"depth":2,"text":"+++ b/Documentation/process/changes.rst"},{"depth":2,"text":"@@ -556,10 +556,6 @@ Ip-route2"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":" - <https://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/utils/net/iproute2/>"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":"-OProfile"},{"depth":2,"text":"---------"},{"depth":2,"text":"-"},{"depth":2,"text":"-- <https://oprofile.sf.net/download/>"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":2,"text":" Kernel documentation"},{"depth":2,"text":" ********************"},{"depth":2,"text":"--"},{"depth":2,"text":"2.54.0"},{"depth":2,"text":""},{"depth":1,"text":""}],"lineCount":24,"maximumDepth":2},{"kind":"signature","text":"~Randy","lineCount":1}],"patchIds":[],"attachmentMetadata":[],"sourceOrdinal":0,"diagnostics":[],"declaredParentMessageId":"875527abdf9df0393ade872c6df3612ae9945b44.camel@mailbox.org"}},"rootIds":["4585926b-f884-4638-83f9-00da23edfcca@infradead.org"],"childrenByParent":{},"chronologicalIds":["4585926b-f884-4638-83f9-00da23edfcca@infradead.org"],"patchSeries":[],"diagnostics":[],"patches":{}}}